    employer type (implementation partner vs product company vs IT services delivery) than most single
    tech roles.
  </p>

  <h2 id="certification-check">Run The 3-Layer Certification Reality Check before you stop at "I'm certified"</h2>

  <p>
    A certification alone does not tell a hiring manager whether you can actually do the job. The
    3-Layer Certification Reality Check is the honest filter to run on your own progress before you
    assume a badge equals job-readiness.
  </p>

