        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>
    If you cannot honestly answer yes to all three, the fix is not another certification. It is going
    back into a free Developer org and building something specific enough that you could walk a hiring
    manager through the exact decisions you made.
  </p>

