    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career
    guidance</a> can walk through your specific situation with an actual person.
  </p>

  <h2 id="salesforce-vs-alternatives">Salesforce vs other CRM and enterprise-tech tracks</h2>

  <p>
    If the real question is "which certification-accessible enterprise-tech path should I pick,"
    Salesforce is one strong answer, not the only one. Comparing it honestly against the closest
    alternatives helps confirm whether Salesforce specifically is the right call, or whether an
    adjacent platform fits your situation better.
  </p>

