        <p>{item.body}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>
    None of these four is objectively "best." Someone drawn to enterprise process work but based in a
    market with more small-business or marketing-led hiring might find HubSpot a genuinely faster
    route in; someone with a strong existing engineering background might get more total career
    optionality from general software development. Salesforce wins specifically on the combination of
    market size and a free, structured, verifiable entry path in India's current hiring landscape.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai-agentforce">Where Agentforce genuinely changes the risk, and where it does not</h2>

  <p>
    Salesforce itself is actively pushing Agentforce and AI-agent tooling as a core part of the
    platform, which makes the AI question in this ecosystem more concrete and more current than in
    most career fields — worth answering honestly rather than with a blanket "AI will/won't replace
    this" claim.
  </p>

